+44) United States (+1) Uruguay (+598) Uzbekistan (+998) Vanuatu (+678) Vatican City (+39) Venezuela (+58) Vietnam (+84) Wallis & Futuna (+681) Western Sahara (+212) Yemen (+967) Zambia (+260) Zimbabwe (+263) Interest 9db17640 Academic Services/Student Support Accounting & Finance Administrative Support Athletics Cooperative Extension Executive/Administrative/Managerial Faculty/Instructor Food/Retail Human Resources Information Technology Marketing/Communications Medical & Health-Related Police/Security Research Service/Facilities/Maintenance Skilled Craft & Trades Technical/Paraprofessional Other Join! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about employment within the OSU/A&M System. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies.  Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). By submitting your information, you acknowledge that you have read and agree to all system campus privacy policies. Thank you Award-winning culture Promoting a positive workplace Highlighting a commitment to employee wellness, development and success, OSU has been recognized by Forbes as a Best-In-State Employer and Best Employer for New Grads. The university was also named to Forbes' Best Midsized Employers in 2024 and 2026 in addition to being included in their list of Dream Employers for 2025. OSU is fostering an environment for employees to thrive while living out the land-grant mission. We are guided by the Cowboy Code, which calls us to turn big dreams into deeds done. To do the impossible – and then do it again. Read more about OSU Rankings University Rankings Quality of Life Rankings Forbes Recognitions Elevate your career Competitive wages, comprehensive benefit packages, access to premier health and wellness facilities , and the opportunity to impact future generations and transform the world are just a few reasons to join the Cowboy family . EXPLORE BENEFITS 13 Paid holidays Eligible employees receive 13 paid holidays per year 50% Tuition waiver Full-time faculty and staff who enroll in standard OSU credit courses may receive a waiver of half the tuition on courses and a waiver of specified fees Dependent Tuition Waiver Supporting higher education for your dependents Dependent children of eligible OSU faculty and staff are eligible to receive a 100% undergraduate student resident tuition waiver for OSU-Stillwater and OSU-Tulsa courses. LEARN MORE Why work at OSU? Our Cowboy Culture The Cowboy family is knit together by a unique set of ideals and standards that drives our Cowboy Culture. By embracing hospitality and esteeming kindness, our Cowboy family welcomes all and is committed to the personal growth of all faculty and staff. Learn more Competitive Benefits OSU provides a comprehensive and competitive benefit package which includes insurance and retirement benefits, in addition to other programs and services. As an employee, you will have the ability to customize a benefit plan that meets the needs of you and your family. Learn more Growth Opportunities OSU fosters a culture that allows for intentional growth for our employees. Our Talent Development and Recruitment department provides more than 17,000 learning opportunities for you to grow both professionally and personally. Learn more Faculty and Staff Awards OSU is renowned for the dedication and expertise of its faculty and staff. Award opportunities are available to thank and recognize our staff for all they do in elevating our campus community and culture. University Convocation Awards Staff Advisory Council Awards Commitment to Equal Opportunity OSU is committed to a policy of equal opportunity for all individuals and does not discriminate based on race, religion, age, sex, color, national origin, marital status, disability, or veteran status with regard to employment, educational programs and activities, and/or admissions. Learn more Employee Assistance Program EAP benefits are offered through GuidanceResources. Benefits offer you and your dependents confidential support, resources and information for personal and work-life issues. These services are part of our employee benefits package and are available at no additional cost. Learn more Success in Sustainability OSU ranked top among the top global universities for its contributions to the United Nations’ Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). For a third year in a row, OSU has outranked much larger universities across the U.S. and worldwide, with its overall rank of 72 among over 1,600 global universities. Learn more There's more... Video Player is loading. Play Video Play Skip Backward Skip Forward Mute Current Time 0:00 / Duration 3:21 Loaded : 0% 0:00 Stream Type LIVE Seek to live, currently behind live LIVE Remaining Time - 3:21 1x Playback Rate Chapters Chapters Descriptions descriptions off , selected Captions captions settings , opens captions settings dialog captions off , selected Audio Track Picture-in-Picture Fullscreen This is a modal window. Beginning of dialog window. Escape will cancel and close the window. Text Color White Black Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Text Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Transparent Caption Area Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Transparent Semi-Transparent Opaque Font Size 50% 75% 100% 125% 150% 175% 200% 300% 400% Text Edge Style None Raised Depressed Uniform Drop shadow Font Family Proportional Sans-Serif Monospace Sans-Serif Proportional Serif Monospace Serif Casual Script Small Caps Reset Done Close Modal Dialog End of dialog window. Happiness happens here Where friends become family A little over an hour away from the two largest cities in the state, Oklahoma State University sits in the heart of America’s Friendliest College Town of Stillwater, Oklahoma. From America’s Greatest Homecoming , The Botanic Garden and the rowdiest stadium in the country, to a variety of arts events, Pete's Pet Posse and more, you are sure to find a friendly atmosphere. LEARN MORE Our commitment to veterans OSU is a Veteran Employer Champion OSU received the Veteran Employer Champion award in 2021, 2022 and 2024. The program was created after a statewide survey was launched at the Governor’s Veteran Symposium in October 2017 with the goal of building an employer network to create programming and peer-to-peer learning for organizations interested in recruiting, hiring and developing veterans in the workplace. OSU was recognized by Forbes as one of America's Best Employers for Veterans in 2024. LEARN MORE Journey to a career at OSU Virtual Tour Visit Stillwater Follow Us University Human Resources Part of the System Operations Oklahoma State University 201 General Academic Building Oklahoma State University Stillwater, OK 74078 (map) (405) 744-5449 | Contact Us Follow US News Events Social Media Directory Facebook LinkedIn Oklahoma State University Campus & Parking Maps All OSU Institutions Careers @ OSU Hire OSU Grads © 2026 Oklahoma State University. All rights reserved. Accessibility Services Campus Safety Access & Community Impact EEO Statement Ethics Point Privacy Notice Terms of Service Trademarks Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalize content such as job recommendations and to analyze our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies, which may impact your user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device. We will never sell your data to third parties. Review your institution's privacy policy below: OSU's privacy notice Langston University's privacy notice Northeastern Oklahoma A&M's privacy notice Connors State College privacy notice Manage Consent Preferences Strictly Necessary Cookies These cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be switched off in our systems. They are usually only set in response to actions made by you which amount to a request for services, such as setting your privacy preferences, logging in or filling in forms. You can set your browser to block or alert you about these cookies, but some parts of the site will not then work. Performance Cookies Performance Cookies: These cookies allow us to count visits and traffic sources so we can measure and improve the performance of our site. They help us to know which pages are the most and least popular and see how visitors move around the site. If you do not allow these cookie we will not know when you have visited our site, and will not be able to monitor its performance. Manage Cookies I do not accept I accept Save"
